        "TileImage": "$($repository 2bd401d0-17af-481f-8748-e6c8e3c47747).Image",
        "Description": "Our client is a die-hard fan  of Corky the Clown, and has commissioned 47 for a series of vigilante hits against very, very evil people. The client can only afford 10 minutes of 47&apos;s service with this first hit due to limited funding, so you&apos;d best not waste time getting the job done.\r\rAct quickly, avoid being spotted, and don&apos;t take off the clown threads (though tempting it may be).",
